57361583410", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_602757364916743_4472869646762931476_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-LxYXTWKWyAQ7kNvwHa4FB4&_nc_oc=Adrq0vcoANkrkwtAca-1oN4qLy_ynRsWjaIQuUGLrwBKKewaLp_kT7eQzv9t8fn6gSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0n1Eauh1uAJNUuOTjk_vhc7WiMA4QqAFZCxJHyYzScPQ&oe=69F21216"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Video.png", "id": "801747277700153", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334050_801747281033486_4967619914442193317_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6CmLct5bBswQ7kNvwE1qIvU&_nc_oc=Adpwaplst3ucNEENA1FKHv7KNjrz7SuWSJYT47QNDLwJ5MfN7y3T_JkLmArM7GTJt7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af19xefS6QEwmzHpJ5rMKkAIgmN8Cy7m6E7JWHJHAghsOw&oe=69F21190"}, "display_name": "DeadZone Zombie", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Massive arsenal with dozens of different weapons, including many different types depending on the player's preference: handgun, shotgun, assault, automatic and a variety of high-damage melee weapons.\n\nMore special is the item and trap system, depending on your attack and defense strategy to choose the right type of trap such as: Fence, Sawblade Trap, Gun Turret, Electrical Turret, Thorn Trap, Fire Turret or Drone.\n\n100 missions with dozens of different types of zombies and bosses will bring you a great challenge and experience.\n\nIn addition, you can team up with friends to conquer the hardest challenge of the game with 100 stages.\n", "short_description": "If you are brave and like to challenge yourself, then surely you will not be disappointed with this virtual reality zombie game, with a world destroyed by zombie virus, endless chase in the Scary background, will definitely create a strong feeling for players, in addition the game also has a coop feature to play with friends. Let's play together now.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "de